, Then you will be presented with a color that indicates whether the conditions are favorable, moderate, or severe. When you view a future weather conditions for that city, Then  you will be  presented with a 5-day forecast that displays the date, an icon representation of weather conditions, the temperature, the wind speed, and the humidity. When you click on a city in the search history, Then you will be presented with current and future conditions for that city.","topics":[],"score":227378,"global_rank":119682},{"name":"SJROHRXD/SJR-homework-week-18","owner":"SJROHRXD","html_url":"https://github.com/SJROHRXD/SJR-homework-week-18","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Workout Tracker \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2640\ufe0f","topics":[],"score":227369,"global_rank":119690},{"name":"RanVaknin/FoodApp","owner":"RanVaknin","html_url":"https://github.com/RanVaknin/FoodApp","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":227369,"global_rank":119699},{"name":"flexwithfrank/orda-gatsby-site","owner":"flexwithfrank","html_url":"https://github.com/flexwithfrank/orda-gatsby-site","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"orda landing pages","topics":[],"score":227369,"global_rank":119702},{"name":"flexwithfrank/gatsby-starter-netlify-cms","owner":"flexwithfrank","html_url":"https://github.com/flexwithfrank/gatsby-starter-netlify-cms","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":227369,"global_rank":119703},{"name":"mihirthatte/boilerplate-npm","owner":"mihirthatte","html_url":"https://github.com/mihirthatte/boilerplate-npm","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":227369,"global_rank":119704},{"name":"amundu/proyecto-cloud","owner":"amundu","html_url":"https://github.com/amundu/proyecto-cloud","stars":0,"forks":0,"w